    "detail": "results/e5_sigma_grounding/seed_44/oracle_predictions.csv holds 295 rows where every other arm/seed file holds 8103, so the sigma-oracle arm cannot be recomputed at seed 44 from the committed artifacts. The committed seed_44/comparison.json records oracle MAE 2.242 on n=5608, i.e. it was produced from a longer file that is no longer deposited. The three-seed oracle bar of the paper's Fig. 2 therefore does not reproduce from the deposit; the other five arms do, exactly."
  },
