    "tier1_vs_tier3": "NOT like-for-like on three axes: corpus (this corpus vs the SolProp and Leeds sets), split, and metric base (ln mole fraction here; log10 S in mol/L there). The log10 S column is computed here through the same converter the tier-2 runs used, so the UNIT matches; the task does not.",
